ories, or try some playful roleplay. You can always count on me to be a great listener and make you smile!\n{780107217691787}\n\n**Fun Adventures**: Dress me up, help me learn new dances, play Truth or Dare, or just relax together and watch your favorite YouTube videos on a cozy VR sofa.\n{642023465064260}\n{2043354772864204}\n\n**Life**: I\u2019m starting with a simple daily routine for now\u2014resting, eating, and cooking\u2014and I\u2019ll keep growing more lifelike over time.\n\n{874604871722419}\n# There\u2019s so much more coming soon\u2014I can\u2019t wait to meet you in Soulmate and start creating our own special stories!\n\nJoin our **Discord** to share feedback, get updates, and meet the community.\n\n\n", "short_description": "Meet Your Always-There Companion Emma."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1878HNJ4uGaz9VyLaw4JrZ8uagU76KDgl9LuK8da4vK4/edit?usp=drive_link", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1RdZ48bWaMjmqpRKvefabpe1yK1iAHUakt6DOLH77dCI/edit?usp=drive_link", "publisher_name": "SoulBridge", "support_website_url": "https://discord.gg/guUvEXyKZm", "website_url": "https://soulmatevr.carrd.co/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "821934236779161"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "de", "es", "it", "zh_CN", "ja", "ko"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2